OL,3,GNEWSAMove to scrap German at GCSE and
OL,4,AA-level described as 'short-sighted'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChanges to GCSEs and A-levels will mean
OL,7,Fseveral qualifications in subjects
OL,8,Fincluding German, Economics and
OL,9,FEngineering are to be scrapped.
OL,11,FThe Northern Ireland exams board, CCEA,
OL,12,Fsaid the subjects will not be offered
OL,13,Fby it from the end of the decade.
OL,15,FOther qualifications to be withdrawn
OL,16,Finclude GCSEs in Leisure Travel and
OL,17,FTourism, Learning for Life and Work and
OL,18,FContemporary Crafts, and the A-level in
OL,19,FProfessional Business Services.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
