OL,3,GNEWSAMove to scrap German at GCSE and
OL,4,AA-level described as 'short-sighted'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCCEA said it had made the "difficult
OL,7,Fdecision" on factors such as "candidate
OL,8,Fentry patterns and the long-term
OL,9,Fsustainability of these subjects".
